    "source_url": "https://render.com/docs/custom-domains",
    "heading": "Custom domains and TLS",
    "parent_context": "render / web-services / lifecycle",
    "text": "Add the domain in service Settings, configure DNS using the linked instructions for your DNS provider, then Verify in Render. Remove conflicting AAAA records because Render uses IPv4. Render issues and renews custom-domain TLS certificates automatically and redirects HTTP to HTTPS. Domain quotas and additional-domain charges depend on the workspace plan.",
