    "source_url": "https://render.com/docs/rollbacks",
    "heading": "Rollback constraints",
    "parent_context": "render / web-services / lifecycle",
    "text": "In Deploys, choose a successful deploy whose build artifact is retained and confirm Rollback to this deploy. Dashboard rollbacks disable automatic deploys; API rollbacks do not. Disks retain their current state. Registry image tags can resolve to different content; digests identify the same image, which must remain available.",
