    "source_url": "https://neon.com/docs/manage/projects",
    "heading": "Project deletion and billing",
    "parent_context": "neon / postgresql / lifecycle",
    "text": "Deleting a Neon project deletes its computes, branches, databases and roles; recovery is available for seven days, after which deletion is permanent. Use Settings, General, Delete project. Deleting all projects does not itself stop paid-plan billing: review Billing and the documented downgrade procedure. This does not establish physical backup-erasure timing.",
