    "parent_context": "cloudflare / pages / lifecycle",
    "text": "Cloudflare Universal SSL certificates have a 90-day validity period. Automatic renewal attempts start 30 days before expiration and continue until 24 hours before expiration. On a partial (CNAME) setup, Domain Control Validation (DCV) must remain configured so HTTP validation succeeds.",
