    "parent_context": "cloudflare / r2 / lifecycle",
    "text": "An R2 bucket must be completely empty and have no active bucket lock rules before deletion. Empty all objects via the Cloudflare dashboard (R2 bucket Settings, Empty Bucket) or Wrangler/S3 API, remove custom-domain associations, then delete the bucket in Settings or with npx wrangler r2 bucket delete.",
